# Pedestrians and the crew van (game/peds.ts, game/vehicles.ts; docs/mechanics/driving.md). On Duboce's
# south side a walker heads east along the sidewalk; the van comes the other way in the kerb lane at
# 7 m/s, 3 m off their line. A skater there would pass unseen; the van's berth is its half width and
# peds.see.vehicle more, so they step aside (2.1 m, the step grown by its half width) and back once it
# has stopped a length away. Then the van waits across the sidewalk with the player in it and a walker
# walks into it: they jump clear (pedStep) and walk round it, staying clear. No hit, no near miss.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 ped at 42 -20 90
cmd 1 van summon 58 -16.4 270
cmd 2 teleport 58 -14.1 -1.3 270
tap use 30
hold up 40..195
hold down 195..285
cmd 700 vehicle exit
cmd 701 ped clear
cmd 702 van summon 47 -19.5 90
cmd 703 ped at 41 -20 90
cmd 704 vehicle enter
run 1300
expect event vehicleEnter{name=crew_van} count == 2
expect event pedStep{side=-2.1} within 190..200
expect peds.aside == 1 at 250
expect peds.aside == 0 at 600
expect event pedStep{side=1.42} within 975..980
expect event pedStep count == 2
expect peds.aside == 1 at 1200
expect no event pedHit
expect no event nearMiss
expect no event bail
